[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1546","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1546.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1492","title":"SGI IRIX diskperf/diskalign 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"IRIX 6.4 系统的 diskperf 和 diskalign 工具存在权限处理缺陷，本地攻击者可利用这些工具创建属于 root 用户的任意文件，从而获得 root 权限。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地访问权限，无法远程利用，影响 IRIX 6.4 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。SGI 已发布安全公告修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1492"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-05-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:33Z","remediation":"安装 SGI 安全公告 19980502-01-P3030 提供的补丁程序 P3030，该补丁修复了 diskperf 和 diskalign 程序的任意文件创建缺陷。若无法安装补丁，可立即以 root 身份执行 `chmod 0 /sbin/diskperf /sbin/diskalign` 移除 setuid 权限作为临时缓解措施。由于 IRIX 6.4 已停止技术支持（EOL），建议尽快迁移至受支持的操作系统平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/348","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2103","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2104","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b4109a5f204e995e8b4c403f2d8e63073bf1f4d9/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1492.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1492","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1492.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9a5386d000a40888283d918a46b8928ffcbfca7b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1492.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fe37e86b4ab6d44c1acc95d76e30f97043bfd67f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-gg8p-p2xw-4wqr/GHSA-gg8p-p2xw-4wqr.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/348/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1492.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cd8244d2-b934-4768-9cbb-5aea6c490864.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/eabc95cdb5ea0fc6b08883f500cfec2a05eaea46/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1546.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1297","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1297.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1039","title":"SGI IRIX 6.4 补丁本地提权漏洞","description":"IRIX 操作系统在 6.4 版本的补丁 2291 和 2848 中，diskalign 与 diskperf 两个工具存在本地权限提升漏洞。由于这些工具在运行过程中会以不安全的方式创建由 root 拥有的文件，本地已登录的普通用户可借助该缺陷操纵文件创建过程，使系统生成被其控制内容的 root 属主文件，进而篡改关键系统文件或替换易受信任的二进制程序，最终达成完全获取 root 权限的本地提权。该漏洞影响安装了上述补丁的 IRIX 6.4 系统，攻击者需具备本地普通用户访问权限，通过正常调用 diskalign 或 diskperf 触发，无需远程网络即可完成利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1039"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-05-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:34Z","remediation":"从受影响补丁版本移除或降级补丁 2291 和 2848，确保 diskalign 与 diskperf 工具不再以 root 权限创建可被本地用户控制的文件；同时联系 SGI 支持获取该公告 (19980502-01-P3030) 对应的修订补丁并正确安装。若无法及时获取补丁，建议将本地用户与 root 操作严格隔离，对 diskalign 和 diskperf 的访问权限设为仅 root 可执行，并在可行情况下迁移至 IRIX 6.5 或更高版本的受支持操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a3a08d51f200d453300fca8b852aada6b8c5985a/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1039.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1039","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-1039.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/44e56ab96b4cc04024678e20a1f15145c3b3cc59/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1039.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b1dd20ab76cf8f3afbe611ea8133362b0532868d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-79vw-mm5h-rh99/GHSA-79vw-mm5h-rh99.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1039.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000300.txt","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/db2259ea67d1f5e8ce454c4a2cee60d344017bd3/1999.tsv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1039.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1297.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0504","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0504.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0303","title":"BNU UUCP 后台程序缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"BNU UUCP 守护进程（uucpd）在处理超长主机名时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的主机名字符串触发该漏洞，导致服务进程崩溃或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 及其他运行 BNU UUCP 组件的系统，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0303"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-05-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:06Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenBSD 至 2.3 及以上版本，或安装对应安全补丁。如 UUCP 服务非必需，在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释 uucpd 行并重启 inetd 服务以禁用该守护进程。同时建议在主机层面通过防火墙限制对 TCP 540 端口的访问，仅允许可信主机通信。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0303"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0504.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1330","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1330.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1096","title":"KDE kscreensaver 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"KDE 桌面环境中的 kscreensaver 屏幕保护程序（klock）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过设置超长的 HOME 环境变量，在触发屏幕锁定时导致缓冲区溢出，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 KDE 早期版本，攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低，可导致完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1096"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:42Z","remediation":"立即移除 kscreensaver 和 klock 二进制文件的 setuid 权限：chmod u-s /opt/kde/bin/kscreensaver /opt/kde/bin/klock。建议升级至 KDE 2.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 HOME 环境变量缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，可在系统级限制本地用户设置过长的 HOME 环境变量长度作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221101925954&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221101925959&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1644","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/83494e95424aced4cfc65648b3019774f7fc51c3/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1096.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1096","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-1096.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03324c0426abad4e55ae7c73b0bba67b9c87e4ea/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1096.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/799c403529fad0f67d5473eea397e9968232a5ec/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p45q-4pfx-vgqg/GHSA-p45q-4pfx-vgqg.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83052/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1096.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/20d729d7fbfed4f1ebc4b8a4255bac83c7c5af70/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1330.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1378","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1378.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1179","title":"The user wants me to generate a Chinese vulnerability title for CVE-1999-1179. The format should be \"厂商 产品 漏洞类型\" (Vendor Product Vulnerability Type). From the known information: - CVE-1999-1179 - Original title: man.sh 代码执行漏洞 - NVD description: Vulnerability in man.sh CGI script, included in May 1998 issue of SysAdmin Magazine, allows remote attackers to execute arbitrary commands. - CVSS: 7.5 (HIGH) - CWE: NVD-CWE-Other This is a CGI script called \"man.sh\" that was included in SysAdmin Magazine. It allows remote attackers to execute arbitrary commands. So the vendor could be \"SysAdmin Magazine\" or just generic, and the product is \"man.sh CGI script\" or similar. A good title following the format: \"SysAdmin Magazine man.sh CGI 远程命令执行漏洞\" or \"SysAdmin Magazine man.sh CGI 代码执行漏洞\" Let me think about what's most appropriate. The vulnerability is in the man.sh CGI script published in SysAdmin Magazine. It allows remote command execution. I'll go with something like: \"SysAdmin Magazine man.sh CGI 远程命令执行漏洞\" Actually, looking at the original title \"man.sh 代码执行漏洞\", and the","description":"man.sh CGI 脚本存在远程命令执行漏洞，该脚本随 1998 年 5 月《SysAdmin Magazine》杂志发布。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 Web 服务器发送特制 HTTP 请求，利用该脚本对用户输入参数过滤不严的缺陷，在目标系统上以 Web 服务器进程权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响配置了 man.sh CGI 脚本的各类 Unix/Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议立即移除或禁用该 CGI 脚本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1179"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-05-15T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:53Z","remediation":"立即删除或停用服务器上的 man.sh CGI 脚本，该脚本未对用户输入进行过滤，允许远程命令执行。如仍需类似功能，应使用经过安全审计的替代实现（如 man.cgi）并确保对用户输入进行严格过滤和验证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/9330","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24df5d59670dfe04b9c86de11fa86df63c0d28f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1179.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1179","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1179.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/228df6a85079f5c6b1ecdfb3d41be685458438ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1179.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4544d3857250fe21711ce8febf38e8822729678f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j683-rf8r-r7h8/GHSA-j683-rf8r-r7h8.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1179.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000298.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/dd9f81e9fd85457bf78c55783cb6a31e9af71d63/1999.tsv","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1378.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0146","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0146.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0055","title":"Sun libnsl 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris 操作系统的 libnsl（网络服务库）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，漏洞源于对 RPC 请求参数长度缺乏正确的边界检查。本地或远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 RPC 数据包触发该漏洞，成功利用后可获得系统的 root 权限，完全控制受影响主机。该漏洞影响 Sun Solaris 2.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0055"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-05-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:28Z","remediation":"立即为 Sun Solaris 安装 Sun Security Bulletin #00172 对应补丁，为 AIX 系统安装 APAR IX80543 修复程序。如无法立即打补丁，可通过限制本地用户登录、移除不可信用户访问权限、对关键系统启用强制访问控制机制（如 SELinux）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/172","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IX80543&apar=only"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0146.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1490","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1490.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1389","title":"3Com Total Control Chassis Frame Relay 安全绕过漏洞","description":"US Robotics/3Com Total Control Chassis（帧中继版本 3.6.22 至 3.7.24）存在安全绕过漏洞。当端口启用 set host prompt 设置时，设备未能正确执行访问过滤规则，远程攻击者只需在 host: 提示符处连续两次输入主机名即可绕过身份验证和访问限制，获取未授权访问权限。该漏洞影响使用帧中继模块的 Total Control 系列设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1389"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-05-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:20Z","remediation":"升级 3Com Total Control Chassis 固件至 3.7.25 及以上版本以修复访问过滤器的绕过问题。如无法升级，可在端口上禁用 \"set host prompt\" 功能，并在上游路由器或防火墙配置严格 ACL，限制对 Frame Relay 端口的未授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221101925916&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/99","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/36911ad057245f7d02822794db0f459d9b4c9b8f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1389.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1389","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1389.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3012e5f1cf9bcfe839897275a956236aed334269/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1389.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5jm7-hvq6-jjvh/GHSA-5jm7-hvq6-jjvh.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/99/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1389.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/4e87ecc1abc33575c55e11407fc842c718c9d6cb/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1490.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1394","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1394.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1204","title":"Check Point Firewall-1 用户定义对象受限关键字处理安全限制绕过漏洞","description":"Check Point Firewall-1 在处理用户自定义对象时未能正确识别 Mail、auth、time 等受限关键字，导致这些对象被创建后，相关防火墙规则会默认使用 \"ANY\" 地址而非预期的限制范围。远程攻击者可利用此缺陷绕过访问控制策略，访问比管理员预期更多的系统资源，造成安全边界失效。该漏洞影响 Check Point Firewall-1 多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1204"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-05-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:56Z","remediation":"立即将所有名为保留关键字（Mail、auth、time、Short、Long、Alert、Account、UserDefined、spoof 等）的用户定义网络对象和服务对象重命名为其他非保留名称，然后重新安装安全策略使更改生效。同时建议升级至 Check Point Firewall-1 后续版本，新版本已内置禁止将保留关键字用作对象名的防护机制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221101925912&w=2","http://www.checkpoint.com/techsupport/config/keywords.html","http://www.osvdb.org/4416","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7293","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e8d44fc9434dcaf08511a3267e0bf049a6756de/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1204.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1204","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1204.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f9199c6ea2112c9d2536a126688b640a45f0982a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1204.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xmpr-j5r4-rg4x/GHSA-xmpr-j5r4-rg4x.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88630/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1204.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000296.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--520b0898-fd3f-4403-9d1f-da0e40014bba.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1394.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1169","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1169.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0816","title":"摩托罗拉 CableRouter 端口 1024 远程未授权配置访问漏洞","description":"Motorola CableRouter 宽带路由器在端口 1024 上开放了未授权的管理与配置服务，任何能够访问该端口的远程用户均可直接连接并对路由器进行配置操作，无需身份认证。攻击者可利用此缺陷远程查看或修改路由器配置，甚至更改网络设置、获取管理员权限，进而控制内网流量或造成网络中断。该漏洞影响运行相关固件的 Motorola CableRouter 设备，攻击条件为攻击者能与目标设备 1024 端口建立网络连通。利用方式简单，仅需向该端口发起连接并使用其配置协议即可完成未授权操作，CVSS 评分高达 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0816"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-05-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:07Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Motorola CableRouter 固件至最新版本（如官方仍提供补丁），或在防火墙层面封禁 TCP 端口 1024 的所有外部访问。若无法升级固件，请在路由器管理界面禁用远程管理功能，并将管理界面访问限制为仅信任的内网 IP 地址段访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.netspace.org/cgi-bin/wa?A2=ind9805B&L=bugtraq&P=R1621","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/df06113bb625f86b49f1950d55874a29f8e76a55/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0816.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0816","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0816.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5297adfba5e91ee22e711c26c523b292d427c0d0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0816.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/90b464bbc2d1b64270a5771429f96b67fbe9e79b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cjmq-x9wr-c6v6/GHSA-cjmq-x9wr-c6v6.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0816.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1a48089c-6157-4609-a5eb-59d8260381a4.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/979579ffd61606c64cf772a1e865f5126788e4ec/1999.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--1a48089c-6157-4609-a5eb-59d8260381a4.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1169.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1225","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1225.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0919","title":"Motorola CableRouter Telnet 连接内存泄漏拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Motorola CableRouter 的 Telnet 服务器存在内存泄漏漏洞，远程攻击者通过发送大量 Telnet 连接请求，可耗尽设备内存资源，导致路由器服务崩溃或无法响应正常请求，造成拒绝服务。攻击无需认证，仅需网络可达即可触发。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0919"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1998-05-10T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，建议限制 Telnet 服务的访问来源 IP，或禁用 Telnet 改用 SSH 管理，并在网络边界部署访问控制策略阻止非授权 Telnet 流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:55:31Z","references":["http://www.netspace.org/cgi-bin/wa?A2=ind9805B&L=bugtraq&P=R1621","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2004"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1225.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1482","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1482.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1361","title":"Microsoft Windows NT WINS 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 3.51 及 4.0 系统中运行的 WINS（Windows Internet 名称服务）存在资源耗尽型拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，即可通过向目标 WINS 服务（默认端口 42）发送大量特制畸形数据包，触发服务器持续记录错误日志，导致系统性能严重下降、硬盘空间被迅速耗尽，最终造成服务不可用。该漏洞已有公开利用工具 coke.c，攻击者只需指定目标地址和发包数量即可实施攻击，利用门槛极低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1361"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-05-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:16Z","remediation":"Windows NT 3.51 和 NT 4.0 已生命周期终止，微软不再提供安全更新，建议尽快升级至受支持的 Windows Server 版本。如无法升级，在防火墙层面限制对 WINS 端口 (TCP/UDP 42) 的访问，仅允许受信任的 WINS 复制伙伴通信。若环境中不使用 WINS，可停止 WINS 服务以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90221101925891&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/41de94138b7cf6e858138ec4e79e16fbec611fa4/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1361.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1361","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1361.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/175fba1f481a7f7cf5bdb5344d3c0e47af1884ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1361.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c2fw-w2fc-pj95/GHSA-c2fw-w2fc-pj95.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1361.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000294.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d7a317c1-51e4-4fb7-b589-926791282272.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8108bbe4fb0e20671face287a302a062844c09bb/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1482.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1302","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1302.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1044","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9115,\"outputTokens\":18,\"totalTokens\":10797}}","description":"Digital UNIX（即 Tru64 UNIX）4.0 至 4.0d 版本中的高级文件系统工具（advfs）存在本地权限提升漏洞。该漏洞源于 advfs 实用程序在处理文件操作时对权限校验逻辑存在缺陷，导致已登录系统的本地普通用户能够利用该工具绕过正常的访问控制机制，将自身权限提升至更高等级（如 root）。攻击条件要求攻击者必须先在目标主机上获得一个合法的本地用户账户，并能够执行受影响的 advfs 相关命令；由于属于本地利用，无需网络访问即可完成。成功利用后，攻击者可完全控制受影响系统，读取、修改或删除任意文件，并执行任意系统级操作，对系统机密性、完整性和可用性构成严重威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1044"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-05-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:35Z","remediation":"建议将 Digital UNIX（Tru64 UNIX）升级至 4.0e 或后续已修复版本，并安装厂商发布的相关补丁。如无法立即升级，应限制普通用户对 advfs 相关程序的访问权限，通过文件系统权限配置（如 chmod 去除 setuid 位）及最小权限原则降低本地提权风险，同时加强审计日志监控异常提权行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/i-050.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7431.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/68b3c685b96421db99cac9beb9d7bc8a6314be79/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1044.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1044","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-1044.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/36499b7630ab4a32d11ab7c901b4c87271211bec/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1044.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/645f3b3aab113438413618cef41319453f39d643/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-74gm-9j59-cq94/GHSA-74gm-9j59-cq94.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1044.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000293.txt","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1302.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0272","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0272.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0126","title":"SGI IRIX xterm 缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 及 Solaris 5.5.1 X11R6.3 系统中 xterm 终端模拟器与 Xaw 部件库存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 xterm 的 `-xrm` 参数传递超长资源字符串触发缓冲区溢出，成功利用后可获得目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞要求攻击者拥有本地账号，攻击复杂度较低，影响 SGI IRIX 和 Solaris 等 UNIX 系统的 X11R6.3 环境。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0126"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1998-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:38Z","remediation":"移除 xterm 的 SUID 权限位：`chmod u-s /usr/bin/X11/xterm`，防止本地用户通过 `-xrm` 参数以 root 权限执行任意代码。同时升级 Solaris 至 5.5.1 以上补丁版本，或从 IRIX 厂商处获取 xterm 安全修补程序。如不使用 Xaw 库程序，建议将其一并移除或降权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/j-010.shtml","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/338","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/297eb115816d3735806f02ee33bb4d2d53ecd5c6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0126.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0126","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0126.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0126.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0126.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0126.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83078/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--160f8a79-d4d5-4c33-8fab-f1a31520e3d2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0272.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1151","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1151.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0796","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":10766,\"outputTokens\":18,\"totalTokens\":10784}}","description":"FreeBSD 操作系统实现的 T/TCP（TCP 扩展事务协议，RFC 1644）在处理事务连接时存在设计缺陷，攻击者可通过伪造源 IP 地址和 TCP 序列号构造欺骗性数据包，从而绕过正常的三次握手与连接认证机制，冒充可信主机发起事务请求。该漏洞影响启用了 T/TCP 扩展的 FreeBSD 系统，攻击条件为攻击者需能够向目标主机发送网络数据包且无需通过完整身份认证，利用方式即构造特制 T/TCP 数据包实施地址欺骗，可能导致未授权访问或会话劫持等安全风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0796"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:04Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 系统到已修复该问题的版本（建议更新至 1999 年 11 月发布的 FreeBSD 3.3-STABLE 或 4.0 及以上版本，应用相关安全补丁）。如无法立即升级，可在内核中禁用 T/TCP 扩展（通过 sysctl 设置 net.inet.tcp.rfc1644=0 关闭 RFC 1644）或在前端防火墙/路由设备上过滤伪造源地址的 T/TCP 连接，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6089","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe807f4098db5a5ad8dcb41a479197724cb9e789/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0796.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0796","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0796.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f7f250b0cc5cc23741447612a2f182f04c36db78/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0796.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f61040ac78eb76aff0a3a68a8a8a4562940d3711/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2q2r-gmfr-mh6v/GHSA-2q2r-gmfr-mh6v.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0796.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154100_154200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4e8e1bc7-3f9d-4b7f-8a7c-1f1589f49db4.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/9d62a17e1fed77f73d80a5cfda0f78f06970e41d/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1151.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0247","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0247.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0108","title":"SGI IRIX 6.3 xrm 本地缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.3 操作系统的 printers 程序中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 xrm 组件提交特制的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，导致以 root 权限执行任意代码，从而完全控制目标系统。该漏洞仅需本地用户权限即可利用，影响 SGI IRIX 6.3 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0108"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1998-05-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:36Z","remediation":"升级 SGI IRIX 至 6.4 及以上版本，或安装 SGI 提供的补丁程序。作为临时缓解措施，限制对受影响系统的本地访问权限，仅授权可信用户使用，并移除 setuid 权限位。鉴于 IRIX 已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/bugtraq/1997/May/191","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19267","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5917e2b15694e167c1fd9ad85775b2bdfc5fe29c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0108.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0108","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0108.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0108.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0108.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0108.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83064/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0828884e-fed7-43ba-9578-192236803d75.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/e7bd3e92452a8dc8da42d94ae3ba208936d5a5b9/1999.tsv","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0247.toml"}]